@OpenBrew.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5123

### List open breweries sorted by name
GET {{OpenBrew.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/breweries?sortBy=name&sortDirection=asc&page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

###

### List open breweries filtered by city + search term
GET {{OpenBrew.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/breweries?city=San%20Diego&search=beer&sortBy=city&sortDirection=asc&page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

###

### List open breweries sorted by distance (requires latitude/longitude)
GET {{OpenBrew.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/breweries?sortBy=distance&sortDirection=asc&latitude=32.7157&longitude=-117.1611&page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

###

### Autocomplete brewery names
GET {{OpenBrew.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/breweries/autocomplete?term=stone&limit=10
Accept: application/json

###

### Validation example (invalid sortBy)
GET {{OpenBrew.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/breweries?sortBy=rating
Accept: application/json
